     ]
    },
    {
     "line_id": "POL-p1-L9",
     "line": 9,
     "text": "3.1 Low back pain with or without leg symptoms. MRI of the lumbar spine is medically necessary when all",
     "style": "body",
     "bbox": [
      76.0,
      238.96,
      541.72,
      250.76
     ]
    },
    {
     "line_id": "POL-p1-L10",
     "line": 10,
     "text": "of the following are documented:",
     "style": "body",
     "bbox": [
      76.0,
      252.56,
      220.52,
      264.36
     ]
    },
    {
     "line_id": "POL-p1-L11",
     "line": 11,
     "text": "(a) Symptoms have been present for at least 6 weeks.",
     "style": "body",
     "bbox": [
      92.0,
      269.16,
      331.55,
      280.96
     ]
    },
    {
     "line_id": "POL-p1-L12",
     "line": 12,
     "text": "(b) The member completed at least 6 weeks of physical therapy or a supervised home exercise",
     "style": "body",
     "bbox": [
      92.0,
      285.76,
      512.16,
      297.56
     ]
    },
    {
     "line_id": "POL-p1-L13",
     "line": 13,
     "text": "program within the 3 months before the request.",
     "style": "body",
     "bbox": [
      92.0,
      299.36,
      304.88,
      311.16
     ]
    },
    {
     "line_id": "POL-p1-L14",
     "line": 14,
     "text": "(c) The member completed a trial of an anti-inflammatory or analgesic medication for at least 4 weeks,",
     "style": "body",
     "bbox": [
      92.0,
      315.96,
      543.27,
      327.76
     ]
    },
    {
     "line_id": "POL-p1-L15",
     "line": 15,
     "text": "unless contraindicated.",
     "style": "body",
     "bbox": [
      92.0,
      329.56,
      194.27,
      341.36
     ]
    },
    {
     "line_id": "POL-p1-L16",
     "line": 16,
     "text": "(d) A clinical re-evaluation after conservative therapy documents persistent symptoms.",
     "style": "body",
     "bbox": [
      92.0,
      346.16,
      473.8,
      357.96
     ]
    },
    {
     "line_id": "POL-p1-L17",
     "line": 17,
     "text": "3.2 Red-flag exception. Criteria 3.1(a) through 3.1(d) do not apply when the record documents any of the",
     "style": "body",
     "bbox": [
      76.0,
      362.76,
      538.45,
      374.56
     ]
    },
    {
     "line_id": "POL-p1-L18",
     "line": 18,
     "text": "following: progressive motor weakness; bowel or bladder dysfunction or saddle anesthesia; or suspected",
     "style": "body",
     "bbox": [
      76.0,
      376.36,
      538.42,
      388.16
     ]
    },
    {
     "line_id": "POL-p1-L19",
     "line": 19,
     "text": "cancer, infection, or fracture.",
     "style": "body",
     "bbox": [
      76.0,
      389.96,
      202.72,
      401.76
     ]
    },
    {
